{'symbol': 'WY', 'date': '2022-02-10 20:15:00', 'title': 'WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY ANNOUNCES 5.9% DIVIDEND INCREASE', 'text': 'SEATTLE, FEB. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY\xa0(NYSE: WY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY BASE CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.18\xa0PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY, REFLECTING A 5.9 PERCENT INCREASE FROM THE PRIOR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.17 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE IN CASH ON\xa0MARCH 18, 2022, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD OF SUCH COMMON STOCK AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0MARCH 4, 2022.'}